    "hook_claim": "\"DNA only gets built one way\": L19-p1, DNA synthesis occurs only in the 5′ to 3′ direction.",
    "analogy": "New pieces \"snap onto\" the 3′ end like blocks clicking together. Check it does not imply pieces can join anywhere else.",
    "new_term": "3′ end (the end new pieces join), introduced with 5′ as the strand's two ends."
  },
